<title>USA: USDA announces CCC lending rates for February.</title>
<headline>USDA announces CCC lending rates for February.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Monday the interest rate for 1996 crop year commodity loans was 6.625 percent in February, up from the prior month.</p>
<p>USDA said the February interest rate for 1995 and prior crop year commodity loans from the Commodity Credit Corp was 5.625 percent.</p>
</text>
